/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 79 0 R
/T (We celebrated the new year in the Netherlands! New years is the only day of the year that residents can launch fireworks in the Netherlands, so for hours people nearby were setting off fireworks and what a sight it was! It is all we heard during the day, which only got crazier as we got closer to midnight. From our apartment window, we were even able to see the many fireworks being launched from The Hague.)
/E (We celebrated the new year in the Netherlands! New years is the only day of the year that residents can launch fireworks in the Netherlands, so for hours people nearby were setting off fireworks and what a sight it was! It is all we heard during the day, which only got crazier as we got closer to midnight. From our apartment window, we were even able to see the many fireworks being launched from The Hague.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [0]
>>
